{"v":4,"catch":"強大的神話。","desc":"“GRADIUS III”是KONAMI於1989年發布的滾動射擊遊戲。\nGradius星球的故事已從傳奇變為神話。在史詩般的太空戰鬥中挑戰“Bacterion”帝國。\n遊戲中添加了一種“編輯模式”，允許玩家自定義其裝備。\n享受玩系列中最好的遊戲！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。\n\n*選項菜單和手冊有日語，英語，法語，德語，意大利語和西班牙語。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-12-24","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f4f8bea279cafc10b8bb9e09784dd07902c91525efbe71187055853bec770d34.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/975eaecab8d83491185f2634d378e47678e6768f1ec8f068d7f6b9bc74b68819.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/71ddaf306611f6875bc78ee682e10cb4c3ec2c9e3cb981c5f17d9d1e90f98303.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bfb4ed46cf1709f8ebaaf6e20d0fe3fc4fb17c1396265d85dc6514bec3e104d1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ef6bf25f2c6eb8f34cfe7eb8d42c5d8f9bbccb830e2d3cded8eef34fc693cada.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8b4bbbbf31e7f0e3702f8b353881e66f8922c1611bcca5c8e030eb94bfcd44d2.jpg"],"titleId":"01006230131a4000","dlc":[]}